     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A* TODODSPPF - Todo Application Display File
     A*
     A* Record Formats:
     A*   TODOSFL  - Subfile record (one row per todo item)
     A*   TODOCTL  - Subfile control (list screen with headings and F-keys)
     A*   TODOFTR  - Footer row 23 when showing incomplete todos only
     A*   TODOFTR2 - Footer row 23 when showing all todos (done + incomplete)
     A*   TODODET  - Add / Edit detail screen
     A*   TODODEL  - Delete confirmation screen
     A*
     A* Indicator Map:
     A*   *IN03  - F3  pressed (Exit)
     A*   *IN05  - F5  pressed (Toggle show/hide completed todos)
     A*   *IN06  - F6  pressed (Add new todo)
     A*   *IN12  - F12 pressed (Cancel)
     A*   *IN50  - SFLDSP   : display subfile records (off = hide rows)
     A*   *IN51  - SFLDSPCTL: display subfile control record
     A*   *IN52  - SFLCLR   : clear subfile before reload
     A*   *IN53  - SFLEND   : bottom-of-list indicator (shows "Bottom")
     A*   *IN54  - Row 3 label in TODOCTL: OFF="F5=Show Done", ON="F5=Hide Done"
     A*   *IN60  - ERRMSG   : error / info message overlay on TODODET
     A*
     A* Built by scripts/ibmi-compile.sh (TOBi); see AGENTS.md for build order.
     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A*
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* TODOSFL - Subfile record format
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R TODOSFL                   SFL
     A* Option input column (user types 2/4/5)
     A            SFLOPT         1A  B  8  2
     A* Display-only fields
     A            TDID           5S 0O  8  4
     A            TDDESC        50A  O  8 11
     A            TDDUE           L  O  8 63DATFMT(*ISO)
     A            TDDONE         1A  O  8 75
     A*
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* TODOCTL - Subfile control record format (the list screen)
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R TODOCTL                   SFLCTL(TODOSFL)
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      SFLSIZ(0099)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0014)
     A                                      CA03(03 'F3=Exit')
     A                                      CA05(05 'F5=Show Done')
     A                                      CA06(06 'F6=Add')
     A                                      ROLLUP(25 'Page Down')
     A                                      ROLLDOWN(26 'Page Up')
     A  50                                  SFLDSP
     A  51                                  SFLDSPCTL
     A  52                                  SFLCLR
     A  53                                  SFLEND(*MORE)
     A*  Screen title and instructions
     A                                  1  2'Todo List'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 30'IBM i RPG Todo Application'
     A* Row 3: instruction line. *IN54 OFF = show done available, ON = hide done.
     A N54                              3  2'F3=Exit   F5=Show Done   F6=Add New+
     A                                      Todo'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A  54                              3  2'F3=Exit   F5=Hide Done   F6=Add New+
     A                                      Todo'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A*  Column headings
     A                                  6  2'Opt'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  6  7'ID'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  6 11'Description'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  6 63'Due Date'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  6 75'Done'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  7  2'---'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  7  7'-----'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  7 11'-----------------------------'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  7 63'----------'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  7 75'----'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A*
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* TODOFTR - List screen footer (row 23) when showing incomplete todos only.
     A* OVERLAY so writing it does not erase TODOCTL's rows.
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R TODOFTR
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                 23  2'Valid options: 2=Edit  +
     A                                      4=Delete  5=Mark Done  +
     A                                      F5=Show Done'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* TODOFTR2 - Footer row 23 when showing all todos (done + incomplete).
     A* OVERLAY so writing it does not erase TODOCTL's rows.
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R TODOFTR2
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                 23  2'Valid options: 2=Edit  +
     A                                      4=Delete  5=Mark Done  +
     A                                      F5=Hide Done'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* TODODET - Add / Edit detail screen
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R TODODET
     A                                      CA03(03 'F3=Cancel')
     A                                      CA12(12 'F12=Cancel')
     A*  Screen title
     A            DETMODE       10A  O  1  2
     A                                  1 30'IBM i RPG Todo Application'
     A                                  3  2'Enter todo details then press+
     A                                      Enter. F3/F12=Cancel'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A*  ID display (only visible during edit - controlled by RPG blanking field)
     A                                  5  2'Todo ID :'
     A            DETID          5S 0O  5 12
     A*  Description input
     A                                  7  2'Description:'
     A            DETDESC       50A  B  7 15CHECK(LC)
     A                                      COLOR(GRN)
     A*  Due date input
     A                                  9  2'Due Date   :'
     A            DETDUE          L  B  9 15DATFMT(*ISO)
     A                                      COLOR(GRN)
     A                                  9 30'(YYYY-MM-DD)'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A*  Error / validation message
     A  60                             11  2'Description cannot be blank. +
     A                                      Press Enter to continue.'
     A                                      COLOR(RED)
     A*
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* TODODEL - Delete confirmation screen
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R TODODEL
     A                                      CA12(12 'F12=Cancel')
     A*  Screen title
     A                                  1  2'Confirm Delete'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 30'IBM i RPG Todo Application'
     A*  Record details
     A                                  5  2'Delete this todo?'
     A                                      COLOR(RED)
     A                                  7  2'ID          :'
     A            DELID          5S 0O  7 16
     A                                  9  2'Description:'
     A            DELDESC       50A  O  9 16
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                 11  2'Due Date   :'
     A            DELDUE          L  O 11 16DATFMT(*ISO)
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A*  Confirmation instructions
     A                                 23  2'Press ENTER to delete.   +
     A                                      F12=Cancel'
     A                                      COLOR(RED)
